            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.9.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Cleanup opens on an answer: how much you can free without losing anything, with one Free up button. The check runs on its own when there is no recent result.</li><li>Free up leaves out dependencies from projects you worked on this month and anything used in the last two days.</li><li>Find your own surplus files: leftover installers, repeat downloads, large old recordings, device backups and stray project builds. Nothing there is ticked for you.</li><li>Let npm, pnpm, Yarn, Bun, pip, uv, Go and Homebrew clean their own caches, each confirmed with its exact command. Remove clean Git worktrees whose commits are pushed or merged.</li><li>Empty Trash from inside the app, and see how much space you got back since opening it. Free up is also in the menu bar.</li><li>Scans run side by side instead of waiting in line, Stop stops at once, and the Move to Trash button stays visible and shows progress.</li></ul>
]]></description>
